      "nonstandard_elements": "Witnessed two outcomes from outside the body (dying/morgue identification vs. life review and transcendent realms). Cosmic 'game board' between opposing entities (Order/Chaos, Good/Evil, Male/Female, nature/industry). Boundary guardian being 'made of light with thousands of geometries and covered in eyes' with voice like 'millions of sincere, loving laughs.'",
